      "content": "it's not just a feeling though. i sit there with the calculator and it just doesnt add up. my salary barely covers the interest on the debt, and now the medical bills for my daughter... if i wasnt eating, if i wasnt taking up space, if i wasnt needing clothes and transport... they'd have so much more breathing room. it feels like my existence is literally costing them their future. how can you say i hold them together when i'm the one pulling them under?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
